A2','stepLeader, tickHeartbeat, abortLeaderTransfer','Current leader and eligible nonlearner transfer target','TransferLeader request, matching append acknowledgement, or election-timeout ticks', ['src-transfer-entry','src-transfer-timeout','src-abort','src-append-read-release'],implementation_guards=['Ignore learner target and self transfer; require target progress.'],writes=['Set target and reset electionElapsed; abort clears only leadTransferee.'],external_effects=['Catch up target or send TimeoutNow; proposals are rejected during transfer.'],important_branches=['Timeout abort keeps the existing leader; it does not directly call appliedTo or append an entry.','Successful transfer leads to a new campaign and new leader entry.'],cross_activity_effects={'A4':'Can suppress an automatic leave proposal attempted by application completion.'})\nb('B-config','A4','raft.applyConfChange, switchToConfig and confchange.Changer','Applied configuration entry and active incoming/outgoing voter sets','Caller applies committed configuration change', ['src-config-consumers','src-config-changer','src-autoleave-select','src-autoleave-interface','src-caller-contract'],implementation_guards=['Simple changes alter at most one voter; joint entry requires nonempty nonjoint base.','Outgoing voters retain progress; demotion to learner is staged until joint exit.','Proposal admission serializes pending changes and requires exit before another joint change.'],writes=['Install incoming/outgoing sets, learners, progress and AutoLeave. Joint exit clears outgoing set and AutoLeave.'],produces_fact_ids=['F-autojoint'],consumes_fact_ids=['F-committed'],external_effects=['Recompute commitment and broadcast/probe under new configuration; abort transfer to removed target.'],important_branches=['switchToConfig commitment advancement broadcasts but does not directly release pending reads.','Removed/demoted leader steps down only when configured to do so.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Changes which Mat