e writes belong to caller; msgsAfterAppend cannot be released before corresponding writes.'],external_effects=['Synchronous Advance steps captured local responses; async storage workers return supplied responses.'],async_boundaries=['Same local worker messages must be processed reliably in order; append/apply targets may proceed independently.','Changed HardState supplies fresh-term stabilization response while unstable entries remain.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Durability qualifies votes and append acknowledgements, including self support.','A5':'Only actual entry/snapshot completion invokes application accounting.'})\nb('B-recover','A3','newRaft, raft.restore, confchange.Restore','Storage InitialState and retained log or received snapshot','Restart construction or MsgSnap', ['src-constructor','src-recovery','src-config-restore','src-log-reconstruct','src-log-commit','src-storage-interface'],produces_fact_ids=['F-autojoint','F-committed'],implementation_guards=['Snapshot index must exceed committed; restore requires follower and recipient membership.','Matching snapshot term/index can fast-forward commitment without replacing log/configuration.'],writes=['Full restore replaces unstable log and reconstructs configuration including AutoLeave; startup loads HardState, caller Applied and enters follower.'],external_effects=['Snapshot acknowledgement is durability-dependent.'],cross_activity_effects={'A2':'Restores participation context without preserving volatile leader authority.','A4':'Reconstructs joint sets and AutoLeave from ConfState.','A5':'Snapshot completion carries committed state independent of issuing term.'})\nb('B-node','A7','node.run and public Node methods','Single event loop around a RawNode','Proposal, received message, tick, ApplyConfChange, Ready, Advance or Stop', ['src-node-loop','src-node-entry','src-proposal-contract','src-rawnode-entry'],implementation_guards=['Synchronous Ready delivery awaits Advance before next batch; other events still